WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.301
This is all about Susie Diaz.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.270
It's Suzie Diaz's party.

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.339
Susie Diaz is running the show.
I'm just gonna show up.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.207
If she needs me to bring beer
or something,

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.276
I'm more than happy to do it.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:12.545
Oh, dude.
Oh, my God.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:15.048
A woman just fainted.
I'm gonna have to call you back.

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:17.550
Ma'am.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:20.119 line:92%
Ma'am.

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:22.622
Oh...um...

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:26.259
[line ringing]

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.064
[ringing]

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.066 align:start position:0%
911.
What is your emergency?

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.802
Yes, yeah. I'm at the corner
of Fifth and Metropolitan,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.837
and I just came up
across this woman,

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:41.174
and she just--she just
passed out on the sidewalk here.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.442 align:end position:100%
Okay.
And is she responsive, sir?

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:43.777
Um...

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:50.083
[dramatic melody]

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.786 align:end position:100%
Okay, sir?
Is she responsive?

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:57.190 align:start size:28% position:72%
Sir? Sir?

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.560
Um, no, she's--
she's not responsive.

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.628
She's...beautiful.

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:05.431
♪ ♪

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.800 align:end position:100%
That is not relevant
to this emergency, sir.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:09.368 size:84% position:58%
An ambulance is on its way.

00:01:09.401 --> 00:01:11.537 align:end position:100%
In the meantime,
I need you to check her pulse.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.506
Check her pulse.
Right, check her pulse.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:14.540
Okay.

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:16.642
[dramatic melody]

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.211 size:84% position:42%
Does she have a pulse, sir?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.846
Oh, she does,

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.581
but her skin is so soft.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.249 align:start position:0%
Sir...

00:01:23.282 --> 00:01:24.784
She doesn't have on
a ton of makeup,

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.452
but she's the kind of girl

00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:28.254
- that just doesn't need it.
- Sir--

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.623
You can see that she put a lot
of thought into her outfit,

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:32.592
but not like she's trying
too hard.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.293
She's perfect.

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:35.327 align:start size:66% position:34%
Sir, may I remind you

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.864 align:end position:100%
that you have not spoken a word
to this woman?

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.532 align:end position:100%
I need you to see
if she's breathing.

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:41.234
Is she breathing?
Yeah, okay. Hold on.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.570
♪ ♪

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:47.240 align:end position:100%
Sir, I need you
to stay on track.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.408
Oh, God. Oh, God,
she's not breathing!

00:01:49.441 --> 00:01:50.643
The love of my life
is not breathing.

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:51.811
You got to save my baby!

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.913 align:end position:100%
Do you know how to give
mouth-to-mouth resuscitation?

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:55.314
Yes, I do.

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:57.717 align:end position:100%
Okay. I need you
to administer that now.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.787
Okay, okay.
[exhales sharply]

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:06.392
No, no.
I ca--I can't.

00:02:06.425 --> 00:02:08.194
I can't do it.
I can't--I can't do it.

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:10.229
It just--
it's disrespectful.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:11.397
I have to be respectful
for her.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:14.300 size:84% position:58%
Sir, this is the only time
it's okay to put your mouth

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.536 align:end position:100%
on an unconscious woman.
Do it.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.738
I just didn't picture it
happening this way,

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.640
and there's butterflies
in my stomach, and I'm just--

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.675
[hyperventilating]
I don't want to mess this up.

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.244
- It's so rare to find--
- Sir, if you can hear me,

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:27.513 size:84% position:42%
an ambulance is on its way.

00:02:27.546 --> 00:02:29.515
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- I need you to calm down.

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:31.284
- Oh, gosh, my head.
- Sir?

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:32.685
- I'm so light-headed.
- Sir, stay with me.

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:34.387
If this is what it feels
like to be in love,

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.623
this is what it must feel like
when you--when you find the one.

00:02:37.656 --> 00:02:40.259 align:start position:0%
Sir, are you there?

00:02:40.292 --> 00:02:43.229
[busy signal beeping]

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:49.736
[sirens approaching]

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.876
Oh, God.

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.844
[phone beeping]

00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:01.514
[line ringing]

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:02.515
[phone ringing]

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:04.650 align:start position:0%
911.
What is your emergency?

00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:08.387
There's an attractive,
confident, well-to-do black man.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.890
He just passed out
right here on the street.

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:13.259 align:start position:0%
Okay.
Ma'am, listen very carefully.

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:16.329 align:start position:0%
I'm going
to need you to marry him.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:17.697
O-okay.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.367
Shouldn't I give him,
like, mouth-to-mouth first?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.935 align:start position:0%
Yeah, girl.
Get you some.

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:24.571 align:start position:0%
Shoot.

